---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Website Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy and data governance practices for the ModelPath studio website.">
  <article>
    <header style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Website Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
        Effective Date: October 13, 2026 | Last Updated: October 13, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy applies solely to the website at <strong>https://modelpath.app</strong> operated by ModelPath. For our individual mobile applications, please refer to their respective application-specific privacy policies linked on each application page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">2. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <p>
        The ModelPath website is a static showcase. We do not require user accounts, logins, cookies, or profile creation. We do not run invasive tracking pixels or behavioral cross-site trackers on this website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">3. Infrastructure &amp; Technical Logs</h2>
      <p>
        Our static website is hosted using Cloudflare infrastructure. Standard, ephemeral server logs (such as IP addresses and user-agent strings) may be processed by Cloudflare at the network edge solely for security, DDoS mitigation, and operational telemetry.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">4. Direct Communications</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact us via email, your email address and message contents are used strictly to answer your question and provide support. We do not sell or lease communication records to third parties.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">5. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions regarding the studio website, email: <a href="mailto:privacy@modelpath.app">privacy@modelpath.app</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
